            "condition": "New",
            "description": "Support Our Troops – Drive with Pride in the 2026 Peterbilt 589\n\nShow your pride on the road with this sharp 2026 Peterbilt 589, featuring a bold Support Our Troops decal and all the power you expect from Peterbilt. Under the hood sits a Cummins X15 with 500 horsepower, backed by an 18-speed manual transmission, and full locking rear-ends for full command in any situation. \n\nBuilt tough with 3.90 rear ends, a 40k suspension, full lockers, with an aftermarket headache rack and 1/2 fenders this truck is ready for demanding work in the woods, on the jobsite, or out on the highway. Equipped with 24.5 tires on aluminum wheels and disc brakes, you’ll have the traction, durability, and stopping power to keep moving with confidence.\n\nDual fuel tanks (RH 100-gallon / LH 80-gallon) to extend your range. And with 54” chrome stacks, this truck has the classic Peterbilt stance that commands respect wherever it goes.\n\n2026 Peterbilt 589\nCummins X15 – 500hp\n18-Speed Manual Transmission\n3.90 Rear Ends with Full Lockers\n40k Suspension\n24.5 Tires on Aluminum Wheels\nDisc Brakes\n54” Chrome Stacks\nRH 100-gal / LH 80-gal Fuel Tanks\nHeadache rack\n\nVisit us at 1931 North Kings Highway and ask for Austin Byrd, or call to learn more.\n\nComfort you’ll feel. Durability you can trust.\r\nBraketype: AIR\r\nHeadlights: Projector\r\nCabToAxleLength: 135\r\nCabToEndOfFrameLength: 190\r\nGrossCombinedWeight: 90000",
