            "description": "BUILT FOR REAL WORK — READY TO EARN\r\n2019 INTERNATIONAL HX DAY CAB\r\nMULTIPLE MATCHING UNITS AVAILABLE\r\n\r\nIf you've been searching for true vocational workhorses, these 2019 International HX Day Cabs are the kind of trucks that keep jobs moving and revenue coming in.\r\n\r\nPowered by the dependable Cummins X15 rated at 450 HP and backed by a driver-controlled 10-speed manual transmission, these trucks deliver the performance, durability, and control operators demand in tough working environments. Whether hauling equipment, pulling lowboys, moving construction materials, supporting municipal operations, or handling heavy vocational work, the HX platform was built for demanding service.\r\n\r\nThe International HX has earned a reputation across the industry for its severe-duty frame strength, rugged construction, and dependable jobsite performance. Unlike lightweight highway tractors, the HX was engineered to withstand the punishment of construction sites, heavy-haul applications, aggregate operations, and other environments where durability matters.\r\n\r\nThese matching units offer fleet buyers the opportunity to standardize equipment, simplify maintenance programs, and add proven vocational trucks with a consistent specification across multiple operators.\r\n\r\nIdeal Applications:\r\n\r\n• Lowboy & Equipment Transport\r\n• Construction & Site Development\r\n• Aggregate & Material Hauling\r\n• Municipal Fleet Operations\r\n• Utility Contractor Work\r\n• Tank Trailer Applications\r\n• Heavy-Haul Support Operations\r\n• Oilfield & Energy Services\r\n• Regional Vocational Hauling\r\n• General Contractor Fleets\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• Multiple Matching Units Available\r\n• Cummins X15 Diesel Engine — 450 HP\r\n• Eaton Fuller 10-Speed Manual Transmission\r\n• Severe-Duty International HX Chassis Platform\r\n• Heavy-Duty Vocational Specification\r\n• Vertical Exhaust Stacks\r\n• Fleet-Maintained Appearance\r\n• Built for Demanding Work Environments\r\n• Ready for Immediate Service\r\n\r\nWhether you're expanding your fleet or adding multiple matching trucks to support growing workloads, these HX day cabs offer the durability, reliability, and proven vocational performance serious operators expect.\r\n\r\nCompetitive financing available. Extended service contract options available.\r\n\r\nCall American Truck Centers today for pricing and availability before these matching HX units are gone.",
