            "description": "FOR SALE — 2020 KENWORTH W990 DAY CAB-Just did New Cam, New Bushings, New Gaskets, and O Rings!\r\n\r\nLong hood presence. Manual transmission. Owner-operator attitude.\r\n\r\nThis 2020 Kenworth W990 Day Cab was built for operators who want more than just another fleet truck. Powered by the 510 HP PACCAR MX-13 and paired with an Eaton 10-speed manual transmission, this truck delivers the performance, control, and road presence serious drivers appreciate every time they hit the highway.\r\n\r\nThis W990 offers the rare combination of late-model reliability, low-mileage condition, and classic long-hood Kenworth styling that continues to dominate the owner-operator market.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n• PACCAR MX-13 — 510 HP\r\n• Eaton 10-Speed Manual Transmission\r\n• Wet Kit Equipped\r\n• Chrome Bumper\r\n• Dual Chrome Exhaust Stacks\r\n• Extra Gauges\r\n• Air Slide 5th Wheel\r\n• 210” Wheelbase\r\n• 3.70 Rear Ratio\r\n• Drum Brakes\r\n• Cruise Control\r\n• Power Steering\r\n\r\nThis truck is an excellent setup for operators pulling end dumps, tanks, lowboys, hopper bottoms, or general freight while still wanting a truck that looks sharp rolling down the road.\r\n\r\nThe W990 continues to be one of the most recognizable and respected trucks on the highway thanks to its aggressive long-hood design, premium driver feel, and owner-operator appeal.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re building your brand, upgrading your current truck, or adding a clean late-model day cab to your fleet, this W990 checks the boxes.\r\n\r\nCompetitive financing and some of the best service contract options in the country are available.\r\n\r\nCall American Truck Centers Denver East today before this W990 disappears.",
