            "description": "FOR SALE — 2007 KENWORTH T800 WIDE BODY TRI-AXLE DAY CAB New Clutch!\r\n\r\nBuilt for operators who demand brute strength, stability, and reliability in severe-duty applications, this 2007 Kenworth T800 Wide Body Tri-Axle is a true heavy-haul workhorse engineered to perform where ordinary trucks fall short.\r\n\r\nPowered by the legendary Cummins ISX rated at an impressive 565 horsepower and paired with an Eaton Fuller 18-speed manual transmission, this truck delivers the torque, control, and pulling power needed for construction, aggregate, heavy haul, oilfield, and off-road vocational work.\r\n\r\nWith ONLY 196,000 verified miles and 6,950 engine hours, this T800 offers an exceptional balance of proven productivity and long-term life remaining.\r\n\r\nHeavy-Duty Specifications:\r\n• Cummins ISX — 565 HP\r\n• Eaton Fuller 18-Speed Manual\r\n• 20,000 lb Spicer Front Axles\r\n• 25,000 lb Watson & Chalin Pusher Axle\r\n• 52,000 lb Rear Axles\r\n• 4.56 Rear Ratio\r\n• 260” Wheelbase\r\n• Wide Body Configuration\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features of this truck is the SAF Holland / Neway AD252-10 air suspension system — widely respected for being one of the toughest and most capable severe-duty suspension systems in the industry. Fully approved for off-highway applications, it was engineered to withstand rugged terrain while maintaining ride stability, load balance, and long-term durability.\r\n\r\nThis T800 isn’t just built to carry weight — it’s built to thrive in demanding environments where dependability matters every day.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re hauling heavy equipment, working construction sites, pulling aggregate, or operating in oilfield applications, this truck was purpose-built to get the job done.\r\n\r\nUnits with this kind of spec, low mileage, and legendary Kenworth durability do not stay on the market long.\r\n\r\nCall American Truck Centers Denver East TODAY before this T800 is gone.",
