            "description": "A recent price reduction makes this 2021 Peterbilt 579 an even more compelling option for those seeking a reliable heavy-duty truck. Powered by a robust PACCAR MX-13 diesel engine delivering 455 horsepower, this model is equipped with a 12-speed transmission designed to handle demanding routes efficiently. With a GVWR of 52,000 pounds, it is well-suited for a variety of hauling and transportation tasks that require strength and durability.\n\nThis Peterbilt 579 features a day cab configuration, making it ideal for regional and local deliveries where overnight accommodations are not necessary. Its proven performance and build quality make it commonly used in freight and logistics operations, providing dependable service over long distances. The odometer reads 301,041 miles, reflecting its experience on the road while maintaining its capability.\n\nFor those interested in adding a high-quality Peterbilt to their fleet, Rush Truck Centers – Los Angeles invites you to explore this truck further. Our knowledgeable team is ready to provide detailed information and assist with your purchase decision. Contact us today to learn more about this Peterbilt 579 and how it can meet your commercial trucking needs. Price does not include state and local taxes; tags; registration or title fees; dealer-imposed fees, including document preparation, processing or servicing fees, or any optional equipment or upfitting work selected by buyer. Valid while supplies last. Images shown may not reflect actual vehicle.\r\nExhaust: Horizontal",
