            "year": 2005,
            "manufacturer": "KENWORTH",
            "model": "W900",
            "condition": "Used",
            "description": "FOR SALE – 2005 KENWORTH W900 TRI-AXLE DAY CAB Built for heavy vocational work and demanding hauling applications, this 2005 Kenworth W900 Tri-Axle Day Cab combines the timeless durability of the W900 platform with the legendary performance of a 355 HP Caterpillar C15 engine and 13-speed Eaton manual transmission. Whether you're hauling aggregates, construction materials, heavy equipment, or operating in specialized vocational applications, this truck is built to deliver dependable performance day after day.\r\n\r\nEquipped with a 60,000 lb GVWR, 12,000 lb front axle, 48,000 lb rear capacity, and a 12,000 lb mid-lift axle, this W900 is designed to maximize payload while maintaining excellent maneuverability. The 260-inch wheelbase, 3.25 rear axle ratio, and air ride suspension provide a stable ride under heavy loads while the sliding fifth wheel offers versatility for a variety of trailer configurations.\r\n\r\nPowered by one of the most sought-after engines in the trucking industry, the Caterpillar C15 delivers proven reliability, excellent low-end torque, and long-term serviceability. Combined with the driver-controlled 13-speed manual transmission, this truck gives experienced operators the control and performance needed for demanding applications.\r\n\r\nInside the cab you'll find power steering, tilt/telescope steering column, driver-side power window, power locks, cloth seating, and cold air conditioning, providing comfort throughout the workday.\r\n\r\nIDEAL APPLICATIONS\r\nHeavy Haul\r\nConstruction\r\nEquipment Transport\r\nAggregate Hauling\r\nLowboy Operations\r\nEnd Dump\r\nFlatbed\r\nSpecialized Vocational Applications\r\n\r\nIf you're looking for a dependable tri-axle Kenworth powered by a Caterpillar engine, this W900 is ready to go to work.\r\n\r\nContact American Motors today for financing options, trade evaluations, warranty information, and complete vehicle details. Inventory moves quickly.",
