            "description": "450 HP DETROIT DD13 • ALLISON RDS AUTOMATIC • 52,000 LB GVWR • 3.91 REAR AXLE RATIO • AIR RIDE SUSPENSION • READY FOR VOCATIONAL WORK\r\n\r\nIdeal Applications-\r\nDump Truck Conversion\r\nRoll-Off or Hooklift Applications\r\nWater Truck\r\nFuel & Lube Truck\r\nFlatbed Operations\r\nEquipment Hauling\r\nUtility Contractors\r\nConstruction Companies\r\nMunicipal Fleets\r\nService Body Applications\r\nCrane or Boom Truck Conversion\r\nGeneral Vocational Work\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n450 HP Detroit DD13 Diesel Engine\r\nAllison RDS 6-Speed Automatic Transmission\r\n52,000 lb GVWR\r\n12,000 lb Front Axle\r\n40,000 lb Tandem Rear Axles\r\n3.91 Rear Axle Ratio\r\nAir Ride Suspension\r\n186\" Wheelbase\r\nSteel Wheels\r\n100-Gallon Fuel Tank\r\nExcellent Air Conditioning\r\nPower Steering\r\nTilt & Telescoping Steering Column\r\nCruise Control\r\nPower Locks\r\nDOT Ready\r\n\r\nBuilt to handle demanding vocational applications where reliability, maneuverability, and low operating costs are essential, this 2016 Freightliner Business Class M2 112 combines the proven Detroit DD13 engine with the legendary Allison RDS automatic transmission. Featuring a heavy-duty 52,000-pound GVWR, tandem rear axles, air ride suspension, and a versatile 186-inch wheelbase, this truck is an outstanding platform for contractors, municipalities, utility companies, equipment haulers, and countless vocational applications.\r\n\r\nBuilt for Vocational Performance!\r\n\r\nThe Freightliner M2 112 was engineered to perform in demanding work environments where durability, ease of operation, and uptime are critical. Its shorter wheelbase provides excellent maneuverability in congested jobsites, urban streets, and industrial facilities while maintaining the strength needed to handle heavy payloads and specialized equipment. Whether you're hauling equipment, operating a service body, or supporting construction operations, the M2 112 was built to work.\r\n\r\nProven Detroit DD13 Power with Allison Automatic Transmission!! Reliable & Strong!!\r\n\r\nPower comes from the dependable 450 HP Detroit DD13, one of the industry's most respected vocational engines. The DD13 delivers strong low-end torque, excellent fuel economy, and long-term durability, making it ideal for operators who spend their days hauling heavy loads, navigating traffic, or working in stop-and-go environments. Its balance of power and efficiency helps reduce operating costs while providing the performance contractors rely on.\r\n\r\nThe Allison RDS 6-speed automatic transmission was specifically designed for demanding vocational service. Known for its durability and smooth operation, the Allison eliminates clutch wear, reduces driver fatigue, and delivers seamless power in traffic, construction sites, and off-road conditions. It is the preferred transmission for operators who require dependable performance and ease of operation throughout the workday.\r\n\r\nHeavy-Duty Axles & 3.91 Rear Axle Ratio!\r\nBuilt with a 12,000-pound front axle, 40,000-pound tandem rear axles, and a 52,000-pound GVWR, this Freightliner is engineered to handle substantial payloads while maintaining excellent stability and durability.\r\nThe 3.91 rear axle ratio provides an outstanding balance between pulling power and road speed. It offers stronger startability and improved grade-climbing ability than higher highway ratios while still allowing efficient operation on regional routes, making it an excellent choice for vocational work that requires both performance and versatility.\r\n\r\nAir Ride Suspension!\r\nThe air ride suspension helps absorb road shock and vibration, improving driver comfort while protecting equipment and cargo from excessive impact. It also provides a smoother ride when operating with varying payloads, helping reduce driver fatigue and extending component life.\r\n\r\nHeavy-Duty Braking Performance!\r\nThe proven air drum brake system delivers dependable stopping power and straightforward maintenance, making it a trusted choice for vocational fleets operating in demanding environments. Its robust design provides consistent braking performance while helping keep maintenance costs under control. \r\n\r\nDesigned for productivity!\r\n\r\nEvery major component on this M2 112 was selected to maximize uptime and simplify daily operation. From the proven Detroit and Allison drivetrain to its maneuverable wheelbase and heavy-duty chassis, this truck was built to keep businesses productive while minimizing downtime and operating costs.\r\n\r\nQuality Trucks. Financing Solutions. Nationwide Delivery.\r\n\r\nAt American Truck Centers and American Motors, we don't just sell trucks—we help owner-operators, contractors, municipalities, and commercial fleets find equipment that fits their business and revenue goals. Financing options are available for all credit situations, and our team can assist with delivery anywhere in the country.\r\n\r\nCall today to speak with a commercial truck specialist and discover why customers nationwide trust American Truck Centers and American Motors for quality used commercial trucks.",
